# TONIC copy / paste of a track's sound and of a page (SHIFT = black key 11):
#   SHIFT + black key 1-8 + SEQ = copy that track's sound (all knobs, level, pan and mute; no trigs);
#   SHIFT + black key 1-8 + REC = paste it into that track (it is not muted by the key);
#   SHIFT + SEL = copy the page on the screen; SHIFT + EDIT = paste it into the selected track (same page).
wait 300
tap EDIT
expect view 14
# track 1: its own sound, a trig on step 1, and muted
param 0 0 3 100
param 0 0 17 90
param 0 0 21 20
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
key b10 down
tapkey b0
key b10 up
expect vmute 1
# track 3 is different
param 0 2 3 30
param 0 2 17 50
param 0 2 21 100
# nothing copied yet: paste says so and changes nothing
key b10 down
key b2 down
tapkey b9
key b2 up
key b10 up
expect sound0.2.3 30
# SHIFT + black key 1 + SEQ copies track 1: no mute, no page change
key b10 down
key b0 down
tapkey b8
key b0 up
key b10 up
expect vmute 1
expect view 14
expect tcsrc 1
# SHIFT + black key 3 + REC pastes it into track 3 (REC does not record, the key does not mute)
key b10 down
key b2 down
key b9 down
key b9 up
key b2 up
key b10 up
expect rec 0
expect sound0.2.3 100
expect sound0.2.17 90
expect sound0.2.21 20
expect vmute 5
# the sequence of track 3 is untouched (no trig came with the sound), track 1 keeps its own
expect hit0.2.0 0
expect hit0.0.0 1
expect sound0.0.3 100
# a page: the screen is on the NOISE ENVELOPE page (knobs: NEMode, NEAtk, NEDcy = pots 10-12)
expect curpage 1
param 0 0 11 100
tapkey b1
param 0 1 11 10
param 0 1 3 11
expect sound0.1.11 10
tapkey b0
# a page is copied from the selected track (track 1) with FUNC + EDIT held + SEQ; the paste (PLAY) needs the same page
key b10 down
press EDIT
tapkey b8
release EDIT
key b10 up
expect view 14
expect curpage 1
expect pcpage 1
tapkey b1
key b10 down
press EDIT
tapkey b9
release EDIT
key b10 up
expect playing 0
expect sound0.1.11 100
# only this page's knobs came: pot 3 of track 2 (another page) stays
expect sound0.1.3 11
# another page (SEL = PITCH MOD): nothing is pasted
param 0 1 11 7
tap SEL
key b10 down
press EDIT
tapkey b9
release EDIT
key b10 up
expect sound0.1.11 7
tap EDIT
expect view 14
# FUNC + EDIT held + REC resets the page's knobs to their power-on values (NEAtk = 0); the other pages stay
key b10 down
press EDIT
tap PLAY
release EDIT
key b10 up
expect sound0.1.11 0
expect sound0.1.3 11
expect rec 0
